        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: New England Patriots, New York Jets, Baltimore Ravens\n- Events: 2009 New England Patriots season, 2010 New England Patriots season, NFL playoffs\n- Concepts: win-loss records, division title, AFC top seed\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2009 New England Patriots season, the New England Patriots finished with a 10–6 record and won their division title.\n- In the 2009 NFL playoffs, the Baltimore Ravens defeated the New England Patriots.\n- In the 2010 New England Patriots season, the New England Patriots improved on their 2009 10–6 record by finishing 14–2, the best record in the league.\n- In the 2010 season, the New England Patriots clinched the top seed in the AFC.\n- In the 2010 NFL playoffs, the New York Jets defeated the New England Patriots.",
